{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41813","headline":"赠蒯亮处士 · 李中","name":"赠蒯亮处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"着得新书义更幽，负琴何处不遨游。\n玄宫寄宿月华冷，羽客伴吟松韵秋。\n满户烟霞思紫阁，一帆风雨忆沧洲。\n吾君侧席求贤切，未可悬瓢枕碧流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}